*undo and redo

u = to undo last change
ctrl+r = to redo the changes

*commands to enter in Insert mode:

i = insert text at the current cusror position
shift+i = insert text at the beginning of the line
a = append text after the current cursor position.
shift+a = append text at the end of the line.
o = open a new line below the current line
shift+o = open a new line above the current line
r = replace a single character
R = replace multiple characters

**Delete , cut , copy and paste

dd = delete current line
<n>dd = delete n lines from the current line
dw = delete word
<n>dw = delete n words from current word

cc = cut the current line
<n>cc = cut n lines
cw = cut word
<n>cw = cut n words

p = paste the cut/copied text
<n>p = paste n times 

yy = copy the current line
<n>yy = copy n lines
yw = copy word
<n>yw = copy n words

**visual mode
u = convert text to lower case
shift+u = convert text to upper case
~ = convert lowecase to upper case and vice versa
y = for copy
c = for cut
d = for delete








